<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway, A&amp;P raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway, A&amp;P raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Safeway Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- It also upgraded Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific Tea Co Inc to outperform from neutral.  </p>
<p>-- Safeway closed at 39-3/8.</p>
<p>-- A&amp;P closed at 25-7/8.</p>
</text>
